   "source": [
    "# Task 2: Similarity Computation — ChromaDB\n",
    "\n",
    "**Student:** Vishal Singh  \n",
    "**Vector Database:** ChromaDB (local persistent)  \n",
    "**Dataset:** Amazon Reviews 2023 (via ClickHouse)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Metrics recorded:\n",
    "- **Precision@10** — how many of ANN top-10 match ENN top-10\n",
    "- **Exact Search Time (ENN)** — brute force, guaranteed correct\n",
    "- **Approximate Search Time (ANN)** — HNSW, fast but approximate\n",
    "- All reported as **mean ± 2×std** across 10 test queries\n",
    "\n",
    "### Dataset sizes tested:\n",
    "- Query 1 (Products): 50k and 500k\n",
    "- Query 2 (Users): 50k and 500k (reviews → users)"
   ]
  },
